{"id":"zengezur-daglari","qid":"Q920874","category":"range","type":"oronym","names":{"az":"Zəngəzur dağları","ru":"Зангезурский хребет","en":"Zangezur Mountains"},"coordinates":[46,39.15],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":null,"regionSource":null,"admin":[{"qid":"Q131083","az":"Naxçıvan Muxtar Respublikası","en":"Nakhchivan Autonomous Republic"}],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Zəngəzur silsiləsi və ya Zəngəzur dağları — Cənubi Qafqazda, Azərbaycan və ərazisində dağ silsiləsi. Şimalda Tərtərçay və Arpaçayın yuxarı axınlarından başlayaraq Araz çayına qədər uzanır. Uzunluğu 130 km-dir.\nDağ silsiləsinin çox hissəsi sıldırım yamaclıdır. Əlvan metallara zəngin mürəkkəb geoloji quruluşa malikdir.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Зангезу́рский хребет (арм. Զանգեզուրի լեռնաշղթա; азерб. Zəngəzur silsiləsi) — горный хребет на Закавказском нагорье (во внутренней части, относящейся к Армянскому нагорью). Длина — около 130 км. Протягивается меридионально от междуречья рек Тертер и Арпа (севернее истока Воротана) до долины Аракса, образуя в своей южной части границу между Арменией и Нахичеванской Автономной Республикой. На территории Ирана продолжением хребта является хребет Карадаг.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"The Zangezur Mountains (Armenian: Զանգեզուրի լեռներ or Սյունյաց լեռներ, ) are a mountain range that defines the border between Armenia's southern provinces of Syunik, Vayots Dzor, and Azerbaijan's Nakhchivan Autonomous Republic. The Zangezur region has the second-largest tract of forests in Armenia. Additionally, located in the Zangezur Mountains, the forests cover more than 20% of the territory of Armenian Syunik province and reach an elevation of 2,200 metres (7,200 ft)-2,400 metres (7,900 ft).","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Zangezur_mountains%2C_Sisian.jpg/960px-Zangezur_mountains%2C_Sisian.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Zangezur_mountains%2C_Sisian.jpg/960px-Zangezur_mountains%2C_Sisian.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":533,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Zangezur_mountains,_Sisian.jpg","title":"Zangezur mountains, Sisian.jpg","artist":"RAFFI YOUREDJIAN","credit":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/62487011@N08/8097831681","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q920874: Zangezur Mountains","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q920874","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Zəngəzur dağları","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Z%C9%99ng%C9%99zur_da%C4%9Flar%C4%B1&oldid=8811273","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Z%C9%99ng%C9%99zur_da%C4%9Flar%C4%B1","revid":8811273,"revDate":"2026-04-21","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Зангезурский хребет","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%97%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B3%D0%B5%D0%B7%D1%83%D1%80%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D1%85%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%82&oldid=153160946","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%97%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B3%D0%B5%D0%B7%D1%83%D1%80%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D1%85%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%82","revid":153160946,"revDate":"2026-05-17","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Zangezur Mountains","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Zangezur_Mountains&oldid=1359811686","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zangezur_Mountains","revid":1359811686,"revDate":"2026-06-17","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"img-1","kind":"commons","title":"File:Zangezur mountains, Sisian.jpg","publisher":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Zangezur_mountains,_Sisian.jpg","licence":"CC BY 2.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"}],"langs":["az","ru","en"],"verification":"review"}